' Notes
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

note right of IMC
  **DelegationProxy Pattern**
  IMC's own use cases: create, process, completion
  Delegated use cases: info, build, test, clean,
    links, tree, upgrade
  All delegated UCs go through
    DelegationProxy.delegateMethod()
    which calls the W4TSC equivalent
end note

note bottom of UC11
  **on() = Context Loading**
  web4tscomponent on ONCE 0.3.23.1 info
  Loads ONCE as context, then
  executes info on ONCE via W4TSC
end note

